` "a dict render error carries no source location rather than a stale one: the last user code evaluated before the render (mk, then the second dict) is unrelated to the dict that fails to render."
mk(k): [k, 1]
pq: dict.of[mk([2, :d]), mk([3, :e])]
other: dict.of[["a b", 1], ["", 2]]
out: { q: pq, o: other }
